          "content": "\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background: #ffffff; border: 0.5px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.12); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0027Segoe UI\u0027, sans-serif; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\n\n  \u003c!-- Description --\u003e\n  \u003cp style\u003d\"font-size: 13px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 16px;\"\u003e\n    This dashboard gives you a complete visual overview of your order review pipeline — track approval rates, spot exceptions early, and monitor order volumes across accounts with interactive charts and real-time data.\n  \u003c/p\u003e\n\n  \u003c!-- Features Grid --\u003e\n  \u003cdiv style\u003d\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"\u003e\n\n    \u003c!-- Feature 1 — Order Status Chart --\u003e\n    \u003cdiv style\u003d\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; padding: 10px 12px; background: #f9fafb; border-radius: 10px; border: 0.5px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.07);\"\u003e\n      \u003cdiv style\u003d\"width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 8px; background: #e1f5ee; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px;\"\u003e\n        \u003cimg src\u003d\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width\u003d\u002716\u0027 height\u003d\u002716\u0027 viewBox\u003d\u00270 0 24 24\u0027 fill\u003d\u0027none\u0027 stroke\u003d\u0027%230F6E56\u0027 stroke-width\u003d\u00272\u0027 stroke-linecap\u003d\u0027round\u0027 stroke-linejoin\u003d\u0027round\u0027 xmlns\u003d\u0027http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\u0027%3E%3Cpath d\u003d\u0027M21.21 15.89A10 10 0 1 1 8 2.83\u0027/%3E%3Cpath d\u003d\u0027M22 12A10 10 0 0 0 12 2v10z\u0027/%3E%3C/svg%3E\" width\u003d\"16\" height\u003d\"16\" alt\u003d\"\" /\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv\u003e\n        \u003cp style\u003d\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #111827; margin: 0 0 2px;\"\u003eOrder Status Breakdown\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003cp style\u003d\"font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; margin: 0; line-height: 1.5;\"\u003eVisualize the split between Pending, Approved, and Exception orders with a live donut chart.\u003c/p\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n\n    \u003c!-- Feature 2 — Monthly Trend --\u003e\n    \u003cdiv style\u003d\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; padding: 10px 12px; background: #f9fafb; border-radius: 10px; border: 0.5px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.07);\"\u003e\n      \u003cdiv style\u003d\"width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 8px; background: #e6f1fb; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px;\"\u003e\n        \u003cimg src\u003d\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width\u003d\u002716\u0027 height\u003d\u002716\u0027 viewBox\u003d\u00270 0 24 24\u0027 fill\u003d\u0027none\u0027 stroke\u003d\u0027%23185FA5\u0027 stroke-width\u003d\u00272\u0027 stroke-linecap\u003d\u0027round\u0027 stroke-linejoin\u003d\u0027round\u0027 xmlns\u003d\u0027http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\u0027%3E%3Cpolyline points\u003d\u002722 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12\u0027/%3E%3C/svg%3E\" width\u003d\"16\" height\u003d\"16\" alt\u003d\"\" /\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv\u003e\n        \u003cp style\u003d\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #111827; margin: 0 0 2px;\"\u003eMonthly Order Trends\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003cp style\u003d\"font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; margin: 0; line-height: 1.5;\"\u003eTrack order volume and total value over time with an interactive line chart.\u003c/p\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n\n    \u003c!-- Feature 3 — Top Accounts --\u003e\n    \u003cdiv style\u003d\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; padding: 10px 12px; background: #f9fafb; border-radius: 10px; border: 0.5px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.07);\"\u003e\n      \u003cdiv style\u003d\"width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 8px; background: #faeeda; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: 